      "created_at": "2013-11-12T22:30:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, in addition to the two Environments for the Vengeance expansion, the &gt;G guys have also posted the write-ups for the Vengeful Five, which include an update to Baron Blade.</p><p>In the write-up, it seems that he's been able to (at least partially/temporarily) create a serum that provides him strength, endurance, and power on the level of his nemesis, Legacy. &nbsp;</p><p>So, gang--what are the implications for the rest of the Sentinels world going forward? &nbsp;Is this serum what drives Blade mad, causing him to kill Pauline? &nbsp;Or is it what finally allows him to best Legacy himself? &nbsp;How is that serum (and its exhaustion aftereffect) going to be represented mechanically?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:41.701Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
