      "created_at": "2013-11-13T03:59:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm thinking, mechanically, it will either deal damage to him, or prevent him from playing cards. How will it wear off though? Are we going to be able to destroy it or will it leave play after a certain trigger comes out? It'd be interesting if it was destroyed after the Baron dealt X damage or something like that (a reverse of omnitron)</p>",
