      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-13T04:33:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One nitpick I have with this news - it's <em>really annoying</em> to have two villain decks that are both officially and exclusively named \"Baron Blade\".&nbsp; The new one really ought to have been named \"Vengeful Blade\" or \"Ex-Baron Blade\" or something, just for distinctiveness.&nbsp; I will be pretending this is actually the case, but it'll be a nuisance to have the cards sitting there with the duplicate name on them.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
