      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-13T14:45:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah I went back through the Rook City and Infernal Relics Kickstarter posts that talk about it, and they all just say Alternate Baron Blade, Cosmitron gets that official title, but Baron Blade doesn't get one.</p><p>So Officially we have Baron Blade, Alternate Baron Blade, and Vengeance Baron Blade.</p><p>Interestingly Alternate Baron Blade is Blade's first attempt at Vengeance, and Vengeance Baron Blade is the first villain with Alternating turns. &nbsp;Somehow confusion must occur!</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:04:22.748Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
